config MTK_X676B_SENSORHUB
	tristate "MediaTek sensorhub 2.0 transport (MT6789 X676B)"
	depends on MTK_SCP_TINYSYS
	help
	  Vendor sensorhub 2.0 transport, ported from the Android 5.10
	  kernel.  It talks to the tinysys SCP over the mbox/IPI driver
	  and exposes the sensor list/events through /dev/hf_manager.
	  This is bring-up code for the Infinix X676B; it is not
	  upstream-quality yet.
